# Destined Confrontation: "Each player chooses any number of creatures they control with total power 4 or less, then sacrifices
# all other creatures they control." (CR 101.4, 608.2d, 701.21a). Bot1 casts it on turn 3 (Plains and three Moxen) with three
# Memnites (power 1 each) against Bot2's seven Memnites and an Ornithopter (power 0). Bot1, who chooses first, may keep any
# number: it keeps one and sacrifices two. Bot2's question refuses five Memnites (total power 5) and accepts four Memnites and
# the Ornithopter (total 4, a creature of no power being as welcome at the limit as before it): the other three Memnites are
# sacrificed, together with Bot1's two.

